# 📦️ wasm-pack output packages share npm names with their parent crates; keep them out of the nx graph.
**/pkg/**
/.🧬semio/🦑️repo/🎫️tickets/**
/.🧬semio/🦑️repo/⚡️cache/**
/.🧬semio/🗺️map/**
**/pkg/package.json
**/.lake/**

# 🧫️ fixture workspaces are standalone workspace roots copied into temporary workspaces by tests; they must never become projects of this repository.
**/🧫️fixtures/**/📋️project.json
**/🧫️fixtures/**/project.json
